<title>USA: First Savings, First Citizens to merge.</title>
<headline>First Savings, First Citizens to merge.</headline>
<dateline>RALEIGH, N.C. 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Savings Financial Corp said Thursday it agreed to merge with First Citizens BancShares.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, First Citizens said it will pay $10.75 in cash for each of the 986,321 outstanding shares of First Savings stock.</p>
